window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>New York Love Stories Volume 1 is a collection of three full novels that can be listened to as standalones or is enhanced when you listen from beginning to end. </p> <p>Never Got Over You<br> The One I Want<br> Crazy in Love</p> <p>This group of family and friends join together in all three books as different character navigates dating and finding love in these modern romances.</p> <p>With favorite tropes such as second chance, billionaires, enemies to lovers, office romance, contemporary romance, friends to lovers, and one surprise pregnancy, this collection of bestselling books will have you swooning, smiling, and falling in love along with the characters.</p> <p>Grab this incredible collection from New York Times bestselling author, S.L. Scott, today!</p>"; 
